3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f67922c9a9a1e578566e7307f3aa56f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Nice to meet you, I'm superfinalx1, an Italian vtuber.\nI found your NSFW art very expressive and detailed, and I love it.\nI'd love to commission you a NSFW art of my vtuber, who's a horse girl like Uma Musume.\nI was thinking something like a school locker room and she's getting changed for practice when suddenly her trainer comes in and finds her half-naked.\nAs for the expression, I was thinking of a mixture of surprise and embarrassment.\nI wanted to focus only on her, so the \"Trainer\" would be an off-screen figure.\nAs for the clothing, I'll leave it up to you to interpret it.\n\nI'll leave my gdrive with the model's references\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1EU0q_hApvU5KVJgoAEQuZ_LDEdWg0nj3?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@inuko_inudog/works/166", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/288c82d6/uploads/origins/4b774d09-8e7e-487f-ba5c-e87c2dc5ad18?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=72c47cf9e75f326c55995552cf309d08", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/288c82d6/uploads/origins/4b774d09-8e7e-487f-ba5c-e87c2dc5ad18?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=72c47cf9e75f326c55995552cf309d08, https://si.imgix.net/288c82d6/uploads/origins/4b774d09-8e7e-487f-ba5c-e87c2dc5ad18?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=795f53f898bcee307378d61377077d59 2x, https://si.imgix.net/288c82d6/uploads/origins/4b774d09-8e7e-487f-ba5c-e87c2dc5ad18?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=277addbfe945e0cbe14588520b6953d4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "お世話になっております。小熊です。\nまたお願いします。\n発情期に入った拙宅のOC2人が性処理係の男らとエッチを楽しんでる光景をお願いします。\n\n人物（キャラデザ）\nユナ\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1aT9iaUfsrN6oX8MA7VKR5NI3ZsmG2sSs?usp=drive_link\nとある村の巫女の片割れ、引っ込み思案でおとなしい性格で基本誰にでも敬語、むっつり※無毛\n(犬系)\nティスカ\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1N42KkMFrG60zDI05SM39I2STI1AJGLXa?usp=drive_link\nもう片割れの巫女、明るく快活で子供に人気、性知識は少し薄い※無毛\n(猫系)\n\n構図\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/131563639\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/135604751\nのように事後だったりの感じでお願いします。発情期のためアへというよりトロ顔系でお願いします。\n体にかけられた精液や使用済みのゴムもいくつかあると嬉しいです。\n\n男性\n女の子が見えるようにさえしていただければとくに指定はありません。竿だけでも良いですし描写無しでも構いません。\n\n可能でしたら\nハート目差分やエロ衣装差分、事前・行為中の差分などあると嬉しいです。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@inuko_inudog/works/165", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8b6bd43c/uploads/origins/88b8c157-87d7-40f9-afb4-fcc8439dc236?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=16cebba2e61a01fad86b504cacbe7ba0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8b6bd43c/uploads/origins/88b8c157-87d7-40f9-afb4-fcc8439dc236?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=16cebba2e61a01fad86b504cacbe7ba0, https://si.imgix.net/8b6bd43c/uploads/origins/88b8c157-87d7-40f9-afb4-fcc8439dc236?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c59e8496b520cfeddd179580b57ababb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8b6bd43c/uploads/origins/88b8c157-87d7-40f9-afb4-fcc8439dc236?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2b70f49762d0311207c237e97ae7b718 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@inuko_inudog/works/164", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ef14fa5c/uploads/origins/3352a0dd-1924-46c5-a656-01408fe0aca1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd87debfef92